        },
        {
          "id": "bc3e82e9-0aaa-4e03-b212-e6f5f13eedd7",
          "from": "them",
          "text": "미안해. 밥 먹고 있었어.",
          "time": "10:53"
        },
        {
          "id": "96741496-97cc-4744-8d42-79ae0b624810",
          "from": "them",
          "text": "왜?",
          "time": "10:53"
        },
        {
          "id": "19928ab4-83e2-477b-87cf-6880e9867ddd",
          "from": "me",
          "text": "전화받아",
          "time": "10:54"
        },
        {
          "id": "0510cb34-7eb7-400e-a43a-3740b870ab93",
          "from": "them",
          "text": "응.",
          "time": "10:54"
        },
        {
          "id": "f818d628-5319-4481-892b-50fdb3c54536",
          "kind": "date",
          "text": "오늘",
          "dateParts": {
            "mode": "relative",
            "relative": "today"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6b83272d-b8b6-4920-ad64-ba24dc93fbc1",
          "from": "them",
          "text": "뭐해?",
          "time": "10:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "34e8349d-2094-47e0-b5f2-ae0f94dd374e",
          "from": "me",
          "text": "대머리새끼가 맞춥법 틀렸다고 지랄지랄하는중",
          "time": "10:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "3052809f-47d4-4ee0-a55b-e9973cb53b6f",
          "from": "me",
          "text": "왜",
          "time": "10:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "c2bbc0b4-785d-4f1b-ac2f-ff6070c75f97",
          "from": "them",
          "text": "보고 싶어서.",
          "time": "10:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "d7ec9758-91af-4f14-9547-d73960892ffe",
          "from": "me",
          "text": "앞으로는 그냥 영상통화 걸어",
          "time": "10:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "3652f478-812c-453b-8108-9c7950696091",
          "from": "me",
          "text": "괜히문자보내지말고",
          "time": "10:55"
        }
      ],
      "draft": "",
      "name": "걸레년",
